/**
 * @defgroup test_support_fake_stream fake_stream
 * @ingroup test_support_reference
 *
 * @brief Fake stream backend for unit tests.
 *
 * @details
 * Provides a deterministic test double for stream-dependent code. Tests can
 * create fake stream handles, configure write and flush results, inject write
 * failures, observe read/write/flush/close call counts, and inspect data written
 * through the fake stream.
 */
